    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d33">

                <pb facs="0141" n="31" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg31"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.51 Struma Valley/2c: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-01-12T10:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                                1928—10 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>2. If requested to do so, you may give proper support to Monks-Ulen proposal to
                    Greek Government for Struma Valley drainage. You should bear in mind, however,
                    that Department’s 42, December 8, noon,<anchor n="52" xml:id="d33-f1"/> and 37,
                    November 18, 6 p.m.,<anchor n="53" xml:id="d33-f2"/> have not been modified.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
